 CNSsolve>! read_data.cns 
 CNSsolve>!    Read the various restraints data 
 CNSsolve>!    (distances and dihedral angles only in this version) 
 CNSsolve>! 
 CNSsolve>! *********************************************************************** 
 CNSsolve>! * Copyright 2003-2022 Alexandre Bonvin, Utrecht University.           * 
